  (text "RECOVERY RAIL:5.270V analog clamp, timed latch-off"
    (at 25.4 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "cdda270c-121b-442b-ab25-86e6f791b1b3")
  )
  (text "DEVELOPMENT: low-VCC FB accuracy, hot SOA and actual loads remain unqualified."
    (at 25.4 31.75 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "bb7f1177-06b9-4c9b-91aa-abe4686e8650")
  )
  (text "Three FETs per function reduce loss; equal linear-fault sharing is not assumed."
    (at 127 105.41 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "0cc8927a-077d-4288-a612-bc10bb14eb57")
  )
  (text "HGATE support / gate-source clamps / controlled startup"
    (at 260.35 106.68 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ea97b226-4bae-407e-81f8-a2ea5748a961")
  )
  (text "REC5_FAULT:active-low global to MCU PA7; single47k R619 pullup to essential+3V3.\nSHDN/ENOUT intentionally NC. Reset PA6 acts through47k R623 and Q609."
    (at 175.26 184.15 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "035e465c-88a8-4b3f-93d7-be753c873ccc")
  )
  (text "5V0_RECOVERY_REG is actual converter output; converter FB and RAW bank stay UPSTREAM.\nR625=330ohm bleed; C632=100nF timer; C626=10nF gate slew; R617/R618=3.57k/1.11k.\nRequire5ms heavy-load admission plus20ms settling and local rail qualification.\n2ms UV reset never bypasses cooldown:>=10s development wait; restore<=0.5A startup state."
    (at 25.4 238.76 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c9cef7fb-23ac-4e4f-bfc4-f09900c3f848")
  )
  (text "Protected bank:2x100uF hybrid+8x22uF ceramic nominal.\nRequire>=112uF bulk /<=0.4ohm cold and>=48uF low-ESR ceramic;external<=100uF.\nActual cap/magnetic/pulse/source bounds and consumer voltage-time limits remain open."
    (at 175.26 223.52 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "044689af-c4c3-400d-ad77-dad2d0a3ebff")
  )
  (text "INTEGRATION IS NOT QUALIFICATION. Low-VCC clamp accuracy and hot linear SOA remain conditional.\nAutonomous3V3 OV containment is absent. S03/S11 API limitations and reused-part review gates remain open."
    (at 25.4 260.35 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "d315a6f0-47bf-4f39-b379-f40c32866479")
  )
